        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 4:13AM AKDT until September 25 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Coastal Waters Forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...E wind 20 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.TONIGHT...E wind 25 kt. Seas 6 ft.
.FRI...E wind 30 kt. Seas 11 ft. Rain showers.
.FRI NIGHT...SE wind 30 kt. Seas 11 ft.
.SAT...SE wind 20 kt. Seas 9 ft.
.SUN...Variable wind 10 kt. Seas 6 ft.
.MON...Variable wind 10 kt. Seas 4 ft.
</description>
